lwext4 master 58bcf89a121b72d4fb66334f1693d3b30e4cb9c5

Changed for viralOS (everything else as upstream):
- metadata_csum_seed support: ext4_sb_csum_seed() in ext4_super.c replaces the nine
  crc32c(UUID) seeds, and the feature is in EXT4_SUPPORTED_FINCOM (ext4_types.h).
